      "alt": "Starterkit STKa8MxNL",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A53 based oni.MX8M Nano</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa8MxNL serves as an evaluation kit tailored for embedded computing engineers. It is rooted in the TQMa8MxNL platform, featuring the Arm Cortex-A53 processor from NXP. This kit stands out with advanced audio capabilities, an integrated Cortex-M4 for versatile processing, and high-speed communication facilitated by 1x Gbit Ethernet and 2x USB 2.0 interfaces. With typical power consumption of 3 watts and integrated security functions, it provides a reliable and efficient solution. Perfect for applications that require advanced graphics and audio processing.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:56:55 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "1718154328384"
      ],
